MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Bon_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Bon_m01_001: To get through this forest, one must follow the paths\nin the correct order according to the signals.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Bon_m01_002: The old mnemonic goes, "{SetColor=Gold}Lights dance about us:\nfrom I to thee, too, from I to thee.{SetColor=Default}"
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Bon_m01_003: Ah, but pardon me. Your Majesty knows this well,\nof course.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c08_Bon_m01: <BLN>There is a trick to it.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Bon_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Bon_m03_001: Have you forgotten the trick to navigating the\nWandering Wood?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Bon_m03_002: "Lights dance about us: from I to thee, too, from I\nto thee." The dancing lights are {SetColor=Gold}glowing butterflies{SetColor=Default},\nand "I," "too," and "thee" are code for {SetColor=Gold}1, 2, and 3{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Bon_m03_003: {SetColor=Gold}Follow the paths marked by butterflies{SetColor=Default} from {SetColor=Gold}one{SetColor=Default},\nto {SetColor=Gold}three{SetColor=Default}, to {SetColor=Gold}two{SetColor=Default}, then {SetColor=Gold}one{SetColor=Default} again, and finally {SetColor=Gold}three{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c08_Bon_m03: <BLN>Have you forgotten the trick?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Bon_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Bon_m02_001: This time, it was Tobias whose quick thinking saved\nthe day.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Bon_m02_002: I curse myself for not having arrived at so simple a\nconclusion on my own.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Bon_m02_003: What good is the Mastermind of Saramis—the Living\nArchive—if he cannot see what is in front of him?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Bon_m02_004: Not only that, but I failed to notice Your Majesty's\nsuffering, despite my constant presence at your side.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Bon_m02_005: I shall work tirelessly to compensate for this blunder.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c08_Bon_m02: <BLN>How could it have eluded me?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Tob_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Tob_m01_001: Hey, boss! You're looking less like death warmed\nover these days. Good to see it!
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Tob_m01_002: <NCA>Apologize for worrying him.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Tob_m01_003: <NCB>Admit your lingering concerns.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Tob_m01_004: <ACA>Nah, I get it. You had stuff to get done—you didn't\nhave time to run everything by us.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Tob_m01_005: <ACB>You worried not even Troy can help with this?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Tob_m01_006: <ACB>Well, the way I see it, it's better to try. Then you'll\nknow for sure instead of wondering, "what if?"
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Tob_m01_007: Gotta say, it's been way too long since I went out\nto Troy's shrine.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Tob_m01_008: The last time musta been during all the chaos around\nyour coronation.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Tob_m01_009: But you know Troy. However long it's been for us,\nshe'll be the same as ever.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c08_Tob_m01: <BLN>You're looking better these days!
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Lil_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Lil_m01_001: I've never met Troy, but I've heard of her.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Lil_m01_002: Can't remember where exactly... Maybe my parents\nwere talking about her.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Lil_m01_003: But that's all I know—that she's some kinda VIP.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Lil_m01_004: You know her, right? What's she like?
MID_LGA_1SEO_c08_Lil_m01: <BLN>So what's Troy like?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Lys_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Lys_m01_001: I believe the shrine where Troy resides is somewhat\nclose to the seafront city of Alecto.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Lys_m01_002: We can be sure we won't be encountering the\nHar Hali in that region.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Lys_m01_003: I wonder... Do you think they know yet that their\nchief Bahr Vahn is dead?
MID_LGA_1SEO_c08_Lys_m01: <BLN>Speaking of Troy's shrine...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Ale_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Ale_m01_001: Um, I have to thank you for our recent match.\nI know that's strange, given that I lost.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Ale_m01_002: But losing that match freed me in a way. I've got\na fresh start in life.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Ale_m01_003: That's why I wanted to say thank you. I'm really\ngrateful for what happened.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c08_Ale_m01_004: Though I have to be honest, Queen Theodora.\nYou were scary to face during that match.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c08_Ale_m01: <BLN>Thank you.